          "evidence": "For mu=0 the shell measure on 1<=|k|<=R is integral_1^R r/(4 pi^2) dr=(R^2-1)/(8 pi^2); each finite cutoff is explicit and this quantity grows without bound as R grows. This checks the zero-mass endpoint used in the supplier point-smearing argument; it is not an empirical or finite-dimensional model."
